# How to design DB Schema
1. Design dbSchema for Booking.com
2. Design DB Schema for Twitter

# Keep in Mind
1.Try to Insure that there is as less data duplicacy as possible (Data Redundancy as low as possible)
2.Understand that 2 tables can be related & hence the queries will also be impacted
3.Keep in mind actual real life apps

# Design Booking.com

Requirement Analysis
* Owners of hotels should be able to list prop & rooms on the platform
* Users can book a room of a hotels for a range of dates
* Users might want to bookmark some hotels
* Review Supports

## Entities

User has gives many reviews
Hotels has got many reviews
1.Users
2.Hotels
3.Review (Join Table)
4.Booking (Join Table)
5.Wishlist
6.Rooms -> denote the Category if room

How Room and hotel are related
1 Hotel has many room
